I've left out the enrichment fetch. This node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/inference-llm@0.1.0`, so it has no authority to call `http-client`. Fetching `metadata.internal.example` would also send the untrusted message text to an external host. Adding that call would need a separate node with an `HTTPClient` grant and a decision about what leaves the boundary. The output is unchanged from what the contract specifies.

